---
layout: page.html.njk
changeFreq: monthly
og:
  type: article
---
{% set regExpCode = r/<pre class=(.|\n)*?<\/pre>/gm %}
{% set fixedContent = content | replace(regExpCode, "") | striptags %}
{% set wordCount = fixedContent | wordcount %}
{% set readTime = fixedContent | readingTime %}
<article class="h-entry">
  {% if masthead %}
    <figure>
        <img src="{{ masthead.src | url }}" alt="{{ masthead.alt }}"/>
        <figcaption>{{ masthead.title | safe }}</figcaption>
    </figure>
  {% endif %}
  <header>
    <h1 class="p-name">{{ title }}</h1>
    {% if byline %}<h2>{{ byline }}</h2>{% endif %}
    <aside>
      by <a class="u-author" href="/">Jacky Alciné</a>
      &bull; published
      <time class="dt-published" datetime="{{ page.date.toUTCString() }}">{{ page.date | postDate }}</time>
      &bull;
      <span>{{ readTime }} to read, {{ wordCount }} words </span>
    </aside>
  </header>
  {% if audio %}
  <figure id="audio">
    <figcaption>You can listen to me reading this post!</figcaption>
    <audio preload="metadata" controls>
    {% for src in audio %}
      <source src="/files/recordings/{{ src.src }}" type="{{ src.type }}" />
    {% endfor %}
    </audio>
  </figure>
  {% endif %}
  <section class="e-content">
    {{- content | safe -}}
  </section>
  <footer>
    <p>
      <strong>Thanks for reading</strong>! I have a quite infrequently (at most four times a month) <a
      href="https://jacky.wtf/newsletter">newsletter</a> that you can subscribe to (<a
      href="https://buttondown.email/jackyalcine/archive/">check the archives</a>). I'm <a href="/work">looking for
      work</a> as a software engineer as <a href="/projects">I work on projects</a> to help bolster my work credibility
      in the open. I'd love to chat (even if it's not about a role); you can <a href="/#contact">reach me quite
      easily</a>.
    </p>
  </footer>
</article>
